    {
      "sentence_id": 1,
      "japanese": "高校３年生の冬、私は大学を受験するために、S市へ行きました。",
      "english_translation": "In my third year of high school during winter, I went to S City in order to take university entrance exams."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "私の育った町からS市までは飛行機で１時間ちょっとでしたが、私は生まれてはじめて一人で飛行機に乗ったので、少し緊張していました。",
      "english_translation": "Although it was just an hour by plane from my hometown to S City, I was a little nervous because it was the first time I had ever flown alone."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "S市の空港から、S駅までバスで行きました。",
      "english_translation": "I took a bus from S City Airport to S Station."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "S駅に着いてから、予約していたホテルを探しました。",
      "english_translation": "Once I arrived at Station S, I went to find the hotel that I had booked."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "地図を見ながら、はじめて歩く街で、ホテルを探しました。",
      "english_translation": "Using the map, I searched for the hotel while walking around in this new city for the first time."
    }
  ],
